@page "/candidates"
<main class="page reports-page">
    <section class="page-heading">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">M26–M28 · RESEARCH SCREENING</p>
            <h1>Parameter candidates</h1>
            <p>Screen bounded grids quickly, retain exact evidence, and replay selected candidates with the authoritative native engine.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="research-badge">Research only</span>
    </section>
    <section class="status-grid">
        <article><span class="card-index">01</span><h2>Propose</h2><p>Vectorbt ranks exploratory candidates from individually sealed M24 specifications.</p></article>
        <article><span class="card-index">02</span><h2>Preserve</h2><p>SQL stores the grid, worker evidence, parameters, metrics and candidate identity.</p></article>
        <article><span class="card-index">03</span><h2>Verify</h2><p>Native C# independently replays selected specifications and stores the complete run evidence.</p></article>
    </section>
    <section class="boundary-banner">
        <div><span class="status-dot"></span><strong>Verification is not qualification</strong></div>
        <p>A native-verified candidate still needs the M16 validation pipeline and M19 certificate before controlled paper trading.</p>
    </section>
</main>
